@startuml use_case_diagram

skinparam defaultFontSize 13

left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "Calculator Application" {
    usecase "Perform basic calculation" as UC_Calc
    usecase "Perform scientific calculation" as UC_Scientific
    usecase "View calculation history" as UC_History
    usecase "Exit application" as UC_Exit

    usecase "Access via CLI" as UC_CLI
    usecase "Access via GUI" as UC_GUI
}

User --> UC_Calc
User --> UC_Scientific
User --> UC_History
User --> UC_Exit

UC_CLI -.-> UC_Calc : alternative
UC_CLI -.-> UC_Scientific : alternative
UC_CLI -.-> UC_History : alternative
UC_CLI -.-> UC_Exit : alternative

UC_GUI -.-> UC_Calc : alternative
UC_GUI -.-> UC_Scientific : alternative
UC_GUI -.-> UC_History : alternative
UC_GUI -.-> UC_Exit : alternative

@enduml